# M8 author flow on a local LEZ v0.4.0-rc1 sequencer (Mac mini, 2026-11-03): a throwaway chain,
# one Storage v0.5.3 node, the registry deployed from artifacts/, LEZ's published local-test key.
# Two bugs this run found were fixed afterwards and rerun (transcript at the end):
#  - the dirty-file list lost its first character ("rogram/"): now `git diff --name-only HEAD`;
#  - adopt's RegisterDeployer defaulted the payer to the (empty) header account: the author pays.

######## sample project: a git copy of the registry repo (the registry guest under another name)

