error: uncommitted changes (rogram/src/lib.rs): commit them first, since the entry records the commit and `verify` rebuilds exactly that (--allow-dirty goes ahead anyway)
exit 1

######## lezreg init --detect
note: 4 guests found; using methods/guest/Cargo.toml (pass --manifest-path for another)
wrote ./lezreg.toml: m8-sample 0.1.0 (guest lez_program_registry in methods/guest/Cargo.toml, risc0-build 3.0.5)
next: commit it, then `lezreg publish --elf <program .bin>` (`lezreg build` makes one)
